        {
          "id": "38wh3qxqn7hs",
          "status": "scheduled",
          "body": "Dear customer,\nWe are writing to inform you about an upcoming scheduled infrastructure maintenance on May 26th 2026.\nThis maintenance will take place outside of your peak hours between 10:00-11:00, CET.\n\nHow will this impact your workload?\nOur underlying infrastructure will be under maintenance upon our cloud provider's request. Some of the following services may be affected for a short period:\n\n- Scenarios processing may be delayed\n- Webhooks processing may be delayed\n- Logging into the platform may not be possible for a short time\n\nWe will inform you once the maintenance is completed. If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach out to our support team.\n\nThank you very much.\nKind regards,\nYour Make Team\n\n[Affected zones: \"us1.make.com,\"us2.make.com\"]",
          "incident_id": "0h69nc595d87",
          "created_at": "2026-05-19T14:34:03.790+02:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-05-19T14:34:03.790+02:00",
